Instance: RWIpharmaApplicantClientCapabilityStatement
InstanceOf: CapabilityStatement
Usage: #definition
Title: "RWI-pharma Applicant Client CapabilityStatement"
Description: "Expected capabilities of the RWI-pharma Applicant Client actor (client) in RWI-pharma regulatory workflows."
